^                   start of a line (m flag)
(?P<date>…)         named group "date"
├─ \d{4}            a digit, exactly 4 times
├─ -                "-" literally
├─ \d{2}            a digit, exactly 2 times
├─ -                "-" literally
└─ \d{2}            a digit, exactly 2 times
␣                   " " literally
(?P<level>…)        named group "level"
└─ INFO|WARN|ERROR  one of 3 alternatives
   ├─ INFO          "INFO" literally
   ├─ WARN          "WARN" literally
   └─ ERROR         "ERROR" literally
\s+                 whitespace, 1 or more (greedy)
(?P<msg>…)          named group "msg"
└─ .*               any char but newline, 0 or more (greedy)
$                   end of a line (m flag)
